# Generated and vendored trees.
node_modules/
build/
dist/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Not ours to format.
package-lock.json

# SQL migrations and the CI validation script are reviewed as SQL; Prettier has
# no SQL parser and must not pretend to have an opinion about them.
supabase/

# Data and generated artefacts. The institution registry snapshots are written by
# `npm run institutions:*`; reformatting them here would fight the generator and
# produce a diff on every regeneration.
data/

# Prose. Documentation is hand-wrapped and reviewed for meaning; Prettier reflows
# every paragraph, which would bury real changes under re-wrapping noise.
**/*.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Staged rollout: not formatted yet, and deliberately so.
#
# The application shell (pages, components, client libs) and the stylesheets are
# asserted on by the test suite as exact source text — around thirty tests read a
# .tsx/.css file and match a formatted fragment. Reformatting that layer today
# fails those tests, and repairing them means rewriting working assertions, which
# is a separate, reviewable change rather than a formatting pass. Prettier covers
# the server, the tooling and the configuration now; see CONTRIBUTING.md
# "Formatting" for the follow-up.
pages/
src/app/
src/components/
src/lib/
src/data/
src/*.css
src/styles/
tests/

# Shipped static asset with a hand-checked shape.
public/manifest.json
